=2 Walkthrough
* Enter {p:Walk of Echoes} for a cutscene.
** All three zoning methods listed below lead to the same section of the {p:Walk of Echoes}. The first one is the most easily accessible.
** **{c=red:Note: }** If you zone in from blue ??? next to the Cavernous Maw & Survival Guide in {z:Batallia Downs}, you will need to exit after the cutscene and go to one of the other locations for the next mission as this is the wrong {p:Walk of Echoes}.
** **{c=red:Note: }** As of 5/12/2026, zoning in from the blue ??? next to the Cavernous Maw & Survival Guide in {z:Batallia Downs} did not require going to another location. You may simply need to leave and return to ??? in {z:Batallia Downs}.
** If you receive the message, "__You are unable to make further progress in Rhapsodies of Vana'diel due to an event occurring in the quest Champion of the Dawn__," then you must zone into {p:Walk of Echoes} from {z:Xarcabard (S)} to activate and receive the cut scene for {q:Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn} and you must complete that quest and then {q:A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion} first. You will not receive the Rhapsodies of Vana'diel 3-14 cutscene upon re-entering {p:Walk of Echoes} after completing these quests, and you may simply proceed to the next Mission. __(verification needed)__
*** I am unclear why, but collecting the three {k:Breath of dawns|Breath of dawn} was all that was needed to skip ahead, and I did not have to finish {q:Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn}.
*** One is able to skip having to complete {q:A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion} by first entering though {z:Xarcabard (S)}, receive the "__You are unable to make further progress in Rhapsodies of Vana'diel due to an event occurring in the quest Champion of the Dawn__, leave using the teleport to Witchfire Glen, re-enter, receive the {q:Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn} cutscene, leave again to Witchfire Glen, and finally re-enter once more to the {p:Walk of Echoes}.

=3 Entering the Walk of Echoes
=4 Method 1:
* Warp from one of the glowing blue **???** next to the {p:Cavernous Maws} in {z:Batallia Downs}, {z:Rolanberry Fields}, and {z:Sauromugue Champaign}
** Either past or present will work for these three areas -- present-day survival guides are the quickest.
** Requires the {@k} {k:Lightsworm}, acquired during {p:Wings of the Goddess} Mission 2, {M:Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning}, or during the early {p:RoV} Mission line.
** As long as the player completed {M:Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning|Back to the Beginning} after August 2015, this should work. The {@k} {k:Lightsworm} you need for this was introduced in the {p:August 2015 Version Update Changes}.

=4 Method 2:
* The Verdical Conflux in {z:Grauberg (S)} at (F-5).
** Requires {p:Wings of the Goddess} Mission 46: {M:When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide}.

=4 Method 3:
* The Verdical Conflux in {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} at (J-9).
** Requires {p:Voidwatch} Quest 15: {q:Glimmer of Hope|Glimmer of Hope|Glimmer of Hope}__.__

